CHAPTER.VERS:
For the soul of the flesh is in the blood; and I have given it to you

          {+}
         on the altar to make atonement for your

          {+}
         souls: for it is the blood that makes atonement by reason of the soul.

Therefore I said to the sons of Israel, No soul of you

          {+}
         will eat blood, neither will any stranger who sojourns among you

          {+}
         eat blood.

For the soul of all flesh is its blood, which is in its living body. Therefore I said to the sons of Israel, You

          {+}
         will eat the blood of no manner of flesh; for the soul of all flesh is its blood: whoever eats it will be cut off.
